S = {'cc': 'TW', 'doc': '# Taiwan 2025: profit-seeking enterprise income tax, withholding on non-residents (1200)\n\nSource: 所得稅法 from law.moj.gov.tw (current text, last amended 2026-09-11; art. 5 last amended 2018-02-07, history\npage checked): `tw/law/moj/ita_current.txt`.\n* **art. 5 (5)**: taxable income ≤ 120,000 exempt; above, 20 % of the whole, "但其應納稅額不得超過營利事業課稅所得額超過\n  十二萬元部分之半數" (item 3: 2018-2019 only).\n* **art. 66-9**: 5 % on undistributed earnings (not modelled).\n* Withholding: **art. 88** + 各類所得扣繳率標準 (dividends 21 %, interest 20 %, royalties 20 %, services 20 % to\n  non-residents): the regulation\'s text was not fetched (B).', 'regimeName': '營利事業所得稅 (profit-seeking enterprise income tax)', 'unsupported': [['company', 'art. 66-9 5 % surtax on undistributed earnings and the alternative minimum tax (所得基本稅額條例) not modelled']], 'taxes': [{'oecd': '1200/1100', 'tax': 'Withholding tax on payments to non-residents', 'statute': '所得稅法 art. 88; 各類所得扣繳率標準 art. 3 (not fetched)', 'dated': 'art. 5 as amended 2018-02-07', 'grade': 'B', 'kernel_parts': ['Wht'], 'unsupported': []}, {'oecd': '1200', 'tax': '營利事業所得稅', 'statute': '所得稅法 art. 5 (5)', 'dated': 'art. 5 as amended 2018-02-07 (unchanged in 2025)', 'grade': 'A', 'kernel_parts': ['charge'], 'unsupported': ['art. 66-9 undistributed earnings 5 %', 'AMT 12 %']}], 'wht': [{'kind': 'dividend', 'rate': 2100, 'statute': '所得稅法 88 (1) 1; 各類所得扣繳率標準 3'}, {'kind': 'interest', 'rate': 2000, 'statute': '各類所得扣繳率標準 3'}, {'kind': 'royalty', 'rate': 2000, 'statute': '各類所得扣繳率標準 3'}, {'kind': 'services', 'rate': 2000, 'statute': '各類所得扣繳率標準 3'}], 'whtName': 'Withholding tax on payments to non-residents', 'guards': ['twTax 120000 == 0', 'twTax 150000 == 15000', 'twTax 1000000 == 200000', 'wht.amount { kind := .dividend, amount := 1000 } == 210', 'wht.amount { kind := .interest, amount := 1000 } == 200', 'wht.amount { kind := .royalty, amount := 1000 } == 200', 'wht.amount { kind := .services, amount := 1000 } == 200'], 'extra_lean': 'def cit : CorpRegime := { name := "營利事業所得稅", sched := Schedule.flat 2000 }\n/-- art. 5 (5) 1-2: nothing up to 120,000; above, 20 % of the whole but at most half of the excess over 120,000. -/\ndef twTax (x : Int) : Int := if x ≤ 120000 then 0 else min (divR .down (2000 * x) BP) ((x - 120000) / 2)\ndef citTw (co : Company) : Charge :=\n  charge .cit "營利事業所得稅" (cit.beforeLosses co) (fun _ => cit.taxableProfit co) twTax (statute := "所得稅法 art. 5 (5) (as amended 2018-02-07)")', 'extra_run': ['[citTw g.company]']}

